      "text": "Houston, TX (FEB. 27. 2026)-\nSome folks in Houston are already saying,\n“Manila, we have a problem”\nSome folks are not excited about the gridlock and honking.  \n\nRegarding this railroad track gridlock; It looks like we are seeing the Waymo’s line up in the morning to begin their disbursement across the city prior to initial pick ups.  \n\nIt will be interesting to see how many passengers get trapped in a Waymo for a full hour at this railroad track.  \n\n#SunsetProject",
