        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Cyber_Trailer/status/2027371849190191253",
        "text": "Houston, TX (FEB.27.2026)-\n@KHOU reports feedback from community about problems with the initial start of Waymo service.\n\nAlthough the reporter doesn’t exactly state this clearly, the issue at the railroad tracks is that parked trains that are near the crossing are causing the Waymo to stop and sit at the railroad tracks instead of passing by.\n\nThe situation she is describing is when the arms are not down and the lights are not flashing.  \n\n#SunsetProject\n#NeedIntelligence\n#ManilaWeHaveAProblem",
